  "ruleText": "Saf-C 602.06 \"Regular business hours\" means the hours in which a business conducts its operations.\n\nSource. #1461, eff 10-16-79; ss by #2249, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2945, eff 1-3-85, EXPIRED: 1-3-91\n\nNew. #5219, eff 9-4-91; ss by #6562, Interim, eff 9-4-97, EXPIRES: 1-2-98; ss by #6615, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED:10-25-05\n\nNew. #8507, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRED: 6-5-06\n\nNew. #8721-B, eff 9-8-06 (formerly Saf-C 602.06), EXPIRED: 9-8-14\n\nNew. #12373, INTERIM, eff 8-31-17, EXPIRED: 2-27-18\n\nNew. #12516, eff 4-23-18 (formerly Saf-C 602.05)",
